## Implementation Phases

### Phase 1 (P0): High-Value, Low-Complexity

**Duration**: 2-3 weeks

**Deliverables**:
- Extended Archives (zst, lz4, cab, iso, deb, rpm, apk, whl, vsix)
- Hex Viewer with editing
- Camera RAW with non-destructive adjustments

